<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assertion shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An assertion-supersession chain cannot contain a cycle."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "assertion shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE { $this modassert:supersedes+ $this . }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assertion shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every evidence relation linked from an assertion must identify that assertion as the resource it evaluates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "assertion shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n      PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modassert:hasEvidenceRelation ?relation .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?relation modevidence:evaluates $this . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#AssertionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
