<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ChecksumShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#Checksum> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "compatibility statement shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every compatibility evidence relation must identify the compatibility statement it evaluates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "compatibility statement shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n      PREFIX modvmi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modvmi:hasEvidenceRelation ?relation .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?relation modevidence:evaluates $this . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
