<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A compatibility statement requires evidence identifying the test, documentation, or review basis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CompatibilityStatementShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "has evidence relation property constraint"@en .
