<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A component membership cannot relate a component to itself."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modinst:parentComponent ?component ;\n              modinst:childComponent ?component .\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A membership configuration must belong to the membership instrument."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modinst:membershipInstrument ?instrument ;\n              modinst:appliesInConfiguration ?configuration .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?configuration modinst:configurationOf ?instrument . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A membership state must describe the membership instrument."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modinst:membershipInstrument ?instrument ;\n              modinst:appliesInState ?state .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?state modinst:stateOf ?instrument . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 04"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A hasMembership discovery link must originate from the membership instrument or recorded parent component."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "component membership shape sparqlconstraint 04"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        ?owner modinst:hasMembership $this .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modinst:membershipInstrument ?owner . }\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modinst:parentComponent ?owner . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applies in configuration property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#InstrumentConfiguration> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Applies in configuration constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must be instances of InstrumentConfiguration."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "applies in configuration property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#appliesInConfiguration> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ComponentMembershipShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
