<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ConflictDecisionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "conflict decision shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ConflictDecisionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A chosen assertion must be a member of the conflict set addressed by the decision."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ConflictDecisionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "conflict decision shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ConflictDecisionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modassert:decisionFor ?conflict ; modassert:chosenAssertion ?chosen .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?conflict modassert:hasConflictMember ?chosen . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ConflictDecisionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
