<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ConflictDecisionShape-chosenAssertion-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
