<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ContextBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "context binding shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ContextBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every context binding linked from an assertion must identify that same assertion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ContextBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "context binding shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ContextBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modcontext: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/context#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        ?assertion modcontext:hasContextBinding $this .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modcontext:contextualizesAssertion ?assertion . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ContextBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
