<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "current snapshot membership constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The current snapshot must also be explicitly retained by the curated knowledge collection."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "curated knowledge collection shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "current snapshot membership constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:currentSnapshot ?snapshot .\n      FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modheritage:hasKnowledgeSnapshot ?snapshot . }\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
