<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "retained snapshot backlink constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every retained snapshot must identify the same curated knowledge collection through snapshotOfCollection."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "curated knowledge collection shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "retained snapshot backlink constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#CuratedKnowledgeCollectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:hasKnowledgeSnapshot ?snapshot .\n      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?snapshot modheritage:snapshotOfCollection $this . }\n    }\n  " .
