<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#DigitalAssetShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modmedia: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/media#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE { $this modmedia:derivedFrom+ $this . }\n    " .
