<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#FunctionalRoleAssignmentShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "functional role assignment shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#FunctionalRoleAssignmentShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A role assignment's state and configuration qualifiers must concern the same musical instrument."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#FunctionalRoleAssignmentShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "functional role assignment shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#FunctionalRoleAssignmentShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modinst:appliesInConfiguration ?configuration ;\n              modinst:appliesInState ?state .\n        ?configuration modinst:configurationOf ?configurationInstrument .\n        ?state modinst:stateOf ?stateInstrument .\n        FILTER (?configurationInstrument != ?stateInstrument)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#FunctionalRoleAssignmentShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#FunctionalRoleAssignmentShape-appliesInConfiguration-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
