<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition evidence consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every heritage-recognition evidence relation must identify that recognition as the resource it evaluates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "heritage recognition evidence consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "heritage recognition shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:hasEvidenceRelation ?relation .\n      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?relation modevidence:evaluates $this . }\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition supersession cycle constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A heritage-recognition supersession chain cannot contain a cycle."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "heritage recognition shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "heritage recognition supersession cycle constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE { $this modheritage:supersedesRecognition+ $this . }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heritage recognition supersession subject constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A heritage recognition may supersede only a recognition of the same resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "heritage recognition shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "heritage recognition supersession subject constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HeritageRecognitionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:recognizesResource ?resource ;\n            modheritage:supersedesRecognition ?earlier .\n      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?earlier modheritage:recognizesResource ?resource . }\n    }\n  " .
