<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "historical claim review shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "historical claim review subject consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every input and conclusion assertion in a historical claim review must assert about the review subject."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "historical claim review shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "historical claim review subject consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:reviewSubject ?subject .\n      $this (modheritage:reviewsAssertion|modheritage:producesAssertion) ?assertion .\n      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?assertion modassert:assertsSubject ?subject . }\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "historical claim review conclusion lineage constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "historical claim review shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The conclusion must be distinct from every input assertion and must identify the historical claim review as its generating activity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "historical claim review conclusion lineage constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "historical claim review shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:producesAssertion ?conclusion .\n      FILTER (\n        EXISTS { $this modheritage:reviewsAssertion ?conclusion } ||\n        NOT EXISTS { ?conclusion modassert:generatedBy $this }\n      )\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "historical review conclusion property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "produces assertion property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#Assertion> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A historical claim review must identify exactly one distinct conclusion assertion."@en .
