<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "historical review conclusion property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#HistoricalClaimReviewShape-producesAssertion-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "produces assertion property constraint"@en .
