<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#IdentifierShape-identifierValue-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#IdentifierShape-identifierValue-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#IdentifierShape-identifierValue-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A reified identifier requires one non-empty lexical value."@en .
