<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#IdentifierShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#IdentifierShape-identifierValue-PropertyShape-02> .
