<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentComponentShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentComponentShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#InstrumentComponent> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument configuration shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A hasConfiguration link must originate from the configuration's instrument or from a state of that instrument."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument configuration shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modinst:configurationOf ?instrument .\n        ?owner modinst:hasConfiguration $this .\n        FILTER (?owner != ?instrument)\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?owner modinst:stateOf ?instrument . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "configuration of property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#MusicalInstrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An instrument configuration requires exactly one instrument for which it is defined."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "configuration of property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#configurationOf> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument configuration shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument configuration shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-configurationOf-PropertyShape-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentConfigurationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#InstrumentConfiguration> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument identity layer shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A resource cannot occupy more than one of the distinct musical-instrument, instrument-state, and instrument-configuration identity layers."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument identity layer shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\n      SELECT DISTINCT $this WHERE {\n        $this a ?leftType, ?rightType .\n        ?leftType rdfs:subClassOf* ?leftLayer .\n        ?rightType rdfs:subClassOf* ?rightLayer .\n        FILTER (?leftLayer IN (\n          modinst:MusicalInstrument,\n          modinst:InstrumentState,\n          modinst:InstrumentConfiguration\n        ))\n        FILTER (?rightLayer IN (\n          modinst:MusicalInstrument,\n          modinst:InstrumentState,\n          modinst:InstrumentConfiguration\n        ))\n        FILTER (?leftLayer != ?rightLayer)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument identity layer shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument identity layer shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentIdentityLayerShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
