<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument source relation shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A source state must be a state of the source instrument named by the same relation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument source relation shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n      PREFIX modvmi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modvmi:sourceInstrument ?instrument ; modvmi:sourceState ?state .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?state modinst:stateOf ?instrument . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument source relation shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every source-relation evidence relation must identify the source relation it evaluates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument source relation shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n      PREFIX modvmi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modvmi:hasEvidenceRelation ?relation .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?relation modevidence:evaluates $this . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has evidence relation property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#EvidenceRelation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An accepted source relation requires at least one qualified evidence relation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentSourceRelationShape-hasEvidenceRelation-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
