<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An instrument state requires exactly one temporal extent; use distinct state resources for distinct extents."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "valid during property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#validDuring> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
