<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument state shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "instrument state shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-stateOf-PropertyShape-02> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape-validDuring-PropertyShape-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#InstrumentStateShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#InstrumentState> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge identity boundary constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge identity boundary shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A curated knowledge collection or fixed knowledge snapshot cannot also be a musical instrument, digital asset, digital surrogate, virtual-instrument product, version, or package."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge identity boundary constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge identity boundary shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modinst: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#>\n    PREFIX modmedia: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/media#>\n    PREFIX modvmi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#>\n    PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\n    SELECT DISTINCT $this WHERE {\n      $this a ?type .\n      ?type rdfs:subClassOf* ?forbiddenLayer .\n      FILTER (?forbiddenLayer IN (\n        modinst:MusicalInstrument,\n        modmedia:DigitalAsset,\n        modmedia:DigitalSurrogate,\n        modvmi:VirtualInstrumentProduct,\n        modvmi:VirtualInstrumentVersion,\n        modvmi:VirtualInstrumentPackage\n      ))\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge identity boundary shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge identity boundary shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#CuratedKnowledgeCollection> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeIdentityBoundaryShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot lineage consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Previous and resulting snapshots must be distinct states of the maintained collection, and the resulting snapshot must identify this generating activity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot lineage consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:maintainedCollection ?collection ;\n            modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n      FILTER (\n        NOT EXISTS { ?result modheritage:snapshotOfCollection ?collection } ||\n        NOT EXISTS { ?result modheritage:snapshotCreatedBy $this } ||\n        EXISTS { $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?result } ||\n        EXISTS {\n          $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous .\n          FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?previous modheritage:snapshotOfCollection ?collection }\n        }\n      )\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot delta consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The added and removed assertion lists must be non-empty as a combined delta and must exactly match the difference between the previous and resulting snapshots."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot delta consistency constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      { FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this (modheritage:addedAssertion|modheritage:removedAssertion) ?change . } }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:addedAssertion ?assertion ;\n              modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?result modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion . }\n      }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:addedAssertion ?assertion ;\n              modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous .\n        ?previous modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion .\n      }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:removedAssertion ?assertion .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n          $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous .\n          ?previous modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion .\n        }\n      }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:removedAssertion ?assertion ;\n              modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n        ?result modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion .\n      }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n        ?result modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n          $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous .\n          ?previous modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion .\n        }\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modheritage:addedAssertion ?assertion . }\n      }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous ;\n              modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n        ?previous modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?result modheritage:includesAssertion ?assertion . }\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modheritage:removedAssertion ?assertion . }\n      }\n      UNION {\n        $this modheritage:addedAssertion ?assertion ;\n              modheritage:removedAssertion ?assertion .\n      }\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot revision cycle constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A knowledge-snapshot revision chain cannot contain a cycle."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot revision cycle constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous ;\n            modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n      ?result (^modheritage:previousSnapshot/modheritage:resultingSnapshot)+ ?previous .\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 04"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot revision chronology constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A resulting knowledge snapshot must have a creation time later than its previous snapshot."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge maintenance activity shape sparqlconstraint 04"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot revision chronology constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:previousSnapshot ?previous ;\n            modheritage:resultingSnapshot ?result .\n      ?previous modheritage:snapshotCreatedAt ?previousTime .\n      ?result modheritage:snapshotCreatedAt ?resultTime .\n      FILTER (?resultTime <= ?previousTime)\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "added assertion property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#Assertion> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every added resource must be typed as a MODAVIS assertion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "added assertion property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#addedAssertion> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-addedAssertion-PropertyShape-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maintained collection property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#CuratedKnowledgeCollection> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A knowledge maintenance activity must identify exactly one maintained collection."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "maintained collection property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#maintainedCollection> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-maintainedCollection-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "previous snapshot property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#KnowledgeSnapshot> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A knowledge maintenance activity may identify at most one preceding snapshot."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "previous snapshot property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#previousSnapshot> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeMaintenanceActivityShape-previousSnapshot-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
