<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "canonical snapshot materialization media type constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The canonical snapshot materialization must declare media type application/n-quads."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "canonical snapshot materialization media type constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modheritage: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/heritage#>\n    PREFIX modmedia: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/media#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE {\n      $this modheritage:canonicalMaterialization ?bitstream .\n      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?bitstream modmedia:mediaType \"application/n-quads\" . }\n    }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot self-checksum exclusion constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "knowledge snapshot shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A knowledge snapshot must not carry a direct checksum; fix the exact canonical materialization bitstream to avoid an ambiguous or self-referential digest."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot self-checksum exclusion constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "knowledge snapshot shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n    PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n    SELECT $this WHERE { $this modevidence:hasChecksum ?checksum . }\n  " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "canonical materialization property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "canonical snapshot materialization property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/media#Bitstream> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A knowledge snapshot must identify exactly one checksum-fixed canonical N-Quads bitstream."@en .
