<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "canonical snapshot materialization property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#KnowledgeSnapshotShape-canonicalMaterialization-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
