<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#LoopPointSetShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "loop point set shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#LoopPointSetShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every loop region in a loop point set must use the same fixed audio signal as the set."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#LoopPointSetShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "loop point set shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#LoopPointSetShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:appliesToSignal ?signal ; modaudio:hasLoopRegion ?region .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?region modaudio:appliesToSignal ?signal . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#LoopPointSetShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
