<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape-extractionRegion-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape-extractionRegion-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Extraction region constraint: exactly 1 value(s) are required; values must be instances of SampleExtractionRegion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape-extractionRegion-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
