<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "midi extraction binding shape"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape-assignedNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape-extractionRegion-PropertyShape-02> .
