<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiExtractionBindingShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/midi#MidiExtractionBinding> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "midi playback binding shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A MIDI note-number range cannot have a minimum greater than its maximum."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "midi playback binding shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modmidi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/midi#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modmidi:minimumNoteNumber ?minimum ; modmidi:maximumNoteNumber ?maximum .\n        FILTER (?minimum > ?maximum)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "midi playback binding shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A MIDI note-on velocity range cannot have a minimum greater than its maximum."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "midi playback binding shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modmidi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/midi#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modmidi:minimumNoteOnVelocity ?minimum ; modmidi:maximumNoteOnVelocity ?maximum .\n        FILTER (?minimum > ?maximum)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "midi playback binding shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The root MIDI note number must fall within any declared note-number range."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "midi playback binding shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modmidi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/midi#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        { $this modmidi:rootNoteNumber ?root ; modmidi:minimumNoteNumber ?minimum . FILTER (?root < ?minimum) }\n        UNION\n        { $this modmidi:rootNoteNumber ?root ; modmidi:maximumNoteNumber ?maximum . FILTER (?root > ?maximum) }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maximum note number property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxInclusive> "127"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Maximum note number constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must use the nonNegativeInteger datatype; value must be at most 127."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "maximum note number property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/midi#maximumNoteNumber> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteNumber-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
