<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteOnVelocity-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maximum note on velocity property constraint"@en .
