<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteOnVelocity-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteOnVelocity-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxInclusive> "127"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#MidiPlaybackBindingShape-maximumNoteOnVelocity-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A MIDI 1.0 note-on velocity selection bound must be from 1 through 127; velocity zero denotes note-off."@en .
