<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#OrganCouplerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "organ coupler shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#OrganCouplerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An organ coupler must connect distinct components; model same-component effects separately."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#OrganCouplerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "organ coupler shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#OrganCouplerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modorgan: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/organ#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modorgan:couplesFrom ?component ;\n              modorgan:couplesTo ?component .\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#OrganCouplerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
