<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#OrganCouplerShape-couplesFrom-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Couples from constraint: exactly 1 value(s) are required; values must be instances of OrganComponent."@en .
