<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-Path-PropertyShape-08> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "projection shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A projection without a named target graph must include its exact projected RDF statement in the validation graph."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "projection shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modassert:projectionSubject ?subject ;\n              modassert:projectionPredicateIri ?predicateIri .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modassert:projectionGraphIri ?graph . }\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n          $this modassert:projectionObject ?object .\n          BIND (IRI(STR(?predicateIri)) AS ?predicate)\n          ?subject ?predicate ?object .\n        }\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n          $this modassert:projectionLiteral ?literal .\n          BIND (IRI(STR(?predicateIri)) AS ?predicate)\n          ?subject ?predicate ?literal .\n        }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "projection shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Projection subject and object values must reproduce the assertion being projected."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "projection shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modassert:projectsAssertion ?assertion ; modassert:projectionSubject ?subject .\n        { FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?assertion modassert:assertsSubject ?subject . } }\n        UNION\n        { $this modassert:projectionObject ?object . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?assertion modassert:assertsObject ?object . } }\n        UNION\n        { $this modassert:projectionLiteral ?literal . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?assertion modassert:assertsLiteral ?literal . } }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "projection shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "The projection predicate IRI must equal the projected-property mapping of the assertion predicate concept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "projection shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modassert: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#>\n      PREFIX assertionpredicate: <https://w3id.org/modavis/vocab/assertion-predicate/>\n      PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modassert:projectsAssertion ?assertion ; modassert:projectionPredicateIri ?projected .\n        ?assertion modassert:assertsPredicate ?predicate .\n        FILTER (\n          ?predicate != assertionpredicate:has-builder ||\n          ?projected != \"https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/instrument#hasBuilder\"^^xsd:anyURI\n        )\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "projection generated by property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Projection generated by constraint: exactly 1 value(s) are required; values must be instances of Activity; values must have node kind IRI."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "projection generated by property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#projectionGeneratedBy> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGeneratedBy-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "projection graph iri property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Projection graph iri constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must use the anyURI datatype; lexical form must match the declared pattern."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "projection graph iri property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#projectionGraphIri> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9+.-]*:" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionGraphIri-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
