<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionLiteral-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "projection literal property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionLiteral-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionLiteral-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Projection literal constraint: at most 0 value(s) are permitted."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionLiteral-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "projection literal property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#ProjectionShape-projectionLiteral-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/assertion#projectionLiteral> .
