<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "public event shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "At least one event source must be the source resource reached through each linked evidence fragment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "public event shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modevent: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/events#>\n      PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modevent:evidencedBy ?relation .\n        ?relation modevidence:usesFragment/modevidence:fragmentOf/modevidence:snapshotOf ?source .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modevent:hasSource ?source . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "public event shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Every event evidence relation must identify that event as the resource it evaluates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "public event shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modevent: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/events#>\n      PREFIX modevidence: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modevent:evidencedBy ?relation .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?relation modevidence:evaluates $this . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#PublicEventShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
