<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sample playback parameters shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A loop point set selected for playback must apply to the sample being played."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "sample playback parameters shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:playsSample ?sample ; modaudio:usesLoopPointSet ?loopSet .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?loopSet modaudio:appliesToSignal ?sample . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sample playback parameters shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A release region selected for playback must apply to the sample being played."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "sample playback parameters shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:playsSample ?sample ; modaudio:usesReleaseRegion ?region .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?region modaudio:appliesToSignal ?sample . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sample playback parameters shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A round-robin index requires a non-empty round-robin group identifier."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "sample playback parameters shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:roundRobinIndex ?index .\n        FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this modaudio:roundRobinGroup ?group . }\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SamplePlaybackParametersShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
