<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SelectorShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SelectorShape-selectorConformsTo-PropertyShape-01> .
