<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SelectorShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/evidence#Selector> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A region reference-channel index must be smaller than the fixed signal's channel count."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:appliesToSignal ?signal ; modaudio:referenceChannelIndex ?index .\n        ?signal modaudio:channelCount ?count .\n        FILTER (?index >= ?count)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A region's release start frame cannot exceed the fixed signal's total frame count."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 02"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:appliesToSignal ?signal ; modaudio:releaseStartFrame ?release .\n        ?signal modaudio:totalFrames ?total .\n        FILTER (?release > ?total)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A region's release start frame cannot precede its inclusive start frame."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 03"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:startFrameInclusive ?start ; modaudio:releaseStartFrame ?release .\n        FILTER (?release < ?start)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 04"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A signal region's exclusive end frame cannot exceed the fixed signal's total frame count."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 04"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:appliesToSignal ?signal ; modaudio:endFrameExclusive ?end .\n        ?signal modaudio:totalFrames ?total .\n        FILTER (?end > ?total)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-04> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-05> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 05"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-05> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A signal region's exclusive end frame must be greater than its inclusive start frame."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-05> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "signal region shape sparqlconstraint 05"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-05> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:startFrameInclusive ?start ; modaudio:endFrameExclusive ?end .\n        FILTER (?end <= ?start)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-05> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applies to signal property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#AudioSignal> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Applies to signal constraint: exactly 1 value(s) are required; values must be instances of AudioSignal."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "applies to signal property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#appliesToSignal> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-appliesToSignal-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "boundary censoring property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Boundary censoring constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must have node kind IRI."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "boundary censoring property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#boundaryCensoring> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryCensoring-PropertyShape-02> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryConfidence-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryConfidence-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "boundary confidence property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryConfidence-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryConfidence-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryConfidence-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxInclusive> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SignalRegionShape-boundaryConfidence-PropertyShape-03> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Boundary confidence constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must use the decimal datatype; value must be at least 0; value must be at most 1."@en .
