<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sustain loop region shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A loop crossfade cannot be longer than the loop interval."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "sustain loop region shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modaudio: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this modaudio:startFrameInclusive ?start ;\n              modaudio:endFrameExclusive ?end ;\n              modaudio:crossfadeFrames ?crossfade .\n        FILTER (?crossfade > (?end - ?start))\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "crossfade frames property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Crossfade frames constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must use the nonNegativeInteger datatype."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "crossfade frames property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#crossfadeFrames> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sustain loop region shape"@en .
