<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-crossfadeFrames-PropertyShape-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> <https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#SustainLoopRegionShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/audio#SustainLoopRegion> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "time span shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A time span must not mix xsd:date and xsd:dateTime boundary systems on the same node."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "time span shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modavis: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#>\n      SELECT $this WHERE {\n        $this ?dateProperty ?dateValue ; ?dateTimeProperty ?dateTimeValue .\n        FILTER (?dateProperty IN (modavis:startDate, modavis:endDate))\n        FILTER (?dateTimeProperty IN (modavis:startDateTime, modavis:endDateTime))\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
