<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "End date constraint: at most 1 value(s) are permitted; values must use the date datatype."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "end date property constraint"@en .
