<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "end date property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "End date constraint: at least 1 value(s) are required."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "end date property constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#endDate> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#TimeSpanShape-endDate-PropertyShape-09> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
