<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#VirtualInstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "virtual instrument identity layer shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#VirtualInstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A resource cannot occupy more than one of the distinct virtual-instrument, product, version, and package identity layers."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#VirtualInstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "virtual instrument identity layer shape sparqlconstraint 01"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#VirtualInstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n      PREFIX modvmi: <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#>\n      PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\n      SELECT DISTINCT $this WHERE {\n        $this a ?leftType, ?rightType .\n        ?leftType rdfs:subClassOf* ?leftLayer .\n        ?rightType rdfs:subClassOf* ?rightLayer .\n        FILTER (?leftLayer IN (\n          modvmi:VirtualMusicalInstrument,\n          modvmi:VirtualInstrumentProduct,\n          modvmi:VirtualInstrumentVersion,\n          modvmi:VirtualInstrumentPackage\n        ))\n        FILTER (?rightLayer IN (\n          modvmi:VirtualMusicalInstrument,\n          modvmi:VirtualInstrumentProduct,\n          modvmi:VirtualInstrumentVersion,\n          modvmi:VirtualInstrumentPackage\n        ))\n        FILTER (?leftLayer != ?rightLayer)\n      }\n    " .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#VirtualInstrumentIdentityLayerShape-SPARQLConstraint-01> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/shapes/exchange/0.1.0#VirtualInstrumentIdentityLayerShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
